<wpt lat="43.457489" lon="-121.878185"><ele>1478.2</ele><name>Highway 58 turnout at Road 5815</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:hwy58-road-5815 (OSM node 40044151, OR 58 / NF 5815 junction); confidence: high; pdf_page: 299; quote: Drive 12.6 miles southeast on Highway 58 to a turnout parking place on the east side of the highway.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.470958" lon="-121.863917"><ele>2118.5</ele><name>Odell Butte summit lookout</name><desc>source: OSM node 357313021 Odell Butte (natural=peak); confidence: high; pdf_page: 299; book_elev_ft: 7032; quote: Road 5815, a wide logging road, climbs moderately steep grades for 5.3 miles to the summit lookout.</desc></wpt>
